their Titans of the comic book movie  world but are Kevin feige and James Gunn  destined to be friends or foes DC  shocked Hollywood when they announced  that James Gunn and Peter saffron had  been tapped to lead DC Studios  overseeing film television and animation  for the comic book giant Gunn being one  of the few people to have worked with  both Marvel and DC is revered by comic  fans for his work on Guardians of the  Galaxy The Suicide Squad and Peacemaker  in a joint statement Gunn and saffron  said we're honored to be the stewards of  these DC characters we've loved since we  were children we're excited to  invigorate the theatrical experience  Around the World As We Tell some of the  biggest most beautiful and grandest  stories ever told hopefully Gunn will be  able to turn around the struggling DC  extended Universe which appears to have  been renamed the DC Universe when Gunn  posted the news to Twitter he was  inundated with congratulations from fans  and celebrities alike fans naturally  started making demands almost  immediately from from Justice League  sequels to poison ivy and Harley Quinn  romances and everything in between but  Gunn still has one foot in Marvel's door  even as he makes his move to DC so how  does the head of the MCU Kevin feige  feel about the announcement in an  interview with The Hollywood Reporter at  the premiere of black panther wakanda  forever Kevin feige commented on James  Gunn's Ascension to the head of DC  Studios unsurprisingly the MCU Czar had  nothing but kind things to say about  guns promotion and he insisted he's  still working closely with Gunn on the  MCU we have a wonderful thing called the  Guardians of Galaxy holiday special  coming out we have one thing called  guardians galaxy vol 3 coming out in May  feige also voiced some light-hearted  concern about gun scheduling  how we have any time to work on DC until  May I don't know but once he does have  the time I'll be very excited and first  in line feige and Gunn insist that there  is no rivalry between the two Studios  and the two seem to be as friendly as  they ever were but that hasn't stopped  fans on social media from pitting the  two Studio heads against each other one  Twitter user wrote Kevin feige  accidentally creating his own arch  nemesis is such a beautiful comic book  Arc others commended feige on his  professionalism in praising gun with one  tweeting Kevin feige might be one of my  favorite people ever it's so wholesome  to see him unconditionally be a Marvel  Studios alum's number one fan even if  it's for a rival Studio that being said  gun's relationship with Disney wasn't  always as peachy as it is now back in  2018 the company fired Gunn for some old  offensive tweets that were dug up by  conservatives angered by guns opposition  to Donald Trump the social media posts  were dug up by conservative media Outlet  The Daily Caller in response to Gunn's  outspoken criticism of the then  president the tweets and question were  posted in 2008 and 2009 Alan horn chair  of Walt Disney Studios at the time said  the offensive attitudes and statements  discovered on James Twitter feed are  indefensible and inconsistent with our  Studio's values and we have severed our  business relationship with him it's  worth noting that in a 2021 Interview  With The Hollywood Reporter Gunn said  that Horn's decision was as much of a  shock to Kevin feige as it was to  anybody else in a now deleted tweet Gunn  responded that in the early days of his  career he thought of himself as a  provocateur often telling jokes that  were outrageous and taboo he also  claimed to have grown as a person since  making those jokes according to deadline  the public apology that Gunn made and  his contrite attitude throughout the  whole process led to Marvel rehiring gun  horn met with gun on several occasions  to discuss the incident and seemed to  think that the director was truly sorry  for his tweets evidently Gunn seems to  have won fans trust over the years too  and most people seem to be perfectly  happy with his new position what his  promotion means for the DC you however  remains to be seen  [Music]
 

